ina is one of the few countries in the region that didn't allow the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  to appreciate in nominal terms, the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  head added.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 --By Erin McCarthy, Dow Jones Newswires; 212-416-2712; erin.mccarthy@dowjones.com\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 (END) Dow Jones Newswires\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 April 14, 2011 18:03 ET (22:03 GMT)\f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJDN000020110414e74e0057x\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
