\par\par \b \uc2 *DJ \uc2 Goldman Sachs\uc2  Raises Argentina 2011 GDP Growth To 6.8% From 5.6%\b0\par\par\uc2 546 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 21 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 2011\par 19:10\par \uc2 Dow Jones Institutional News\par \uc2 DJDN\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 2011, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.  \par \par \uc2 21 Mar 2011 15:03 EDT DJ  \uc2 Goldman Sachs\uc2  Lifts Argentina 2011 GDP Growth To 6.8% From 5.6%\par \par \uc2 BUENOS AIRES (Dow Jones)--\uc2 Goldman Sachs\uc2  on Monday lifted its forecast for Argentina's economic growth this year to 6.8% from 5.6% following a bigger-than-expected expansion in the economy during the second half of last year.\par \par \uc2 "Leading and coincident indicators show that activity remained quite strong during 1Q11, and the authorities seem bent on maintaining very strong fiscal and monetary stimulus ahead of the October presidential elections," \uc2 Goldman Sachs\uc2  economist Alberto Ramos said in a report.\par \par \uc2 Argentina's gross domestic product expanded 9.2% last year as the economy bounced back from what many economists say was a recession in 2009. Last year's growth was underpinned by strong domestic consumption and booming trade with Brazil.\par \par \uc2 However, an overheated economy and expanding money supply have contributed to double-digit gains in consumer prices.\par \par \uc2 Most private-sector economists say inflation is running at about 25%, while the government said last week that inflation as measured by its consumer price index eased to 10% at the end of February.\par \par \uc2 President Cristina Fernandez and her ministers have made it clear that the administration has no intentions of cooling the economy.\par \par \uc2 The credibility of national statistics agency Indec's economic data has been called into question since former President Nestor Kirchner purged the agency in 2007, which led to a sharp divergence between government data and private-sector estimates. By understating inflation, the government can also report rosier GDP figures.\par \par \uc2 Inflation has become firmly entrenched above 20%, with the Torcuato di Tella University's monthly survey of inflation expectations published Monday showing that Argentines expect consumer prices to rise 25% during the next 12 months.\par \par \uc2 The Fernandez administration has played down inflationary pressures in the economy, attributing whatever pricing pressures that might exist to the actions of greedy businessmen.\par \par \uc2 Earlier this month, the government took the unusual step of fining no fewer than three economic research firms for publishing consumer-price estimates that differ from official estimates.\par \par \uc2 The ability of labor unions to win salary increases equal to or greater than inflation as well as government subsidies to poor, informal sector workers have so far blunted the corrosive effects of rising consumer prices on the public's buying power.\par \par \uc2 However, exporters, specially in the manufacturing sector, are seeing their competitiveness undermined by rising domestic costs and a relatively stable exchange rate.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  of \b \highlight22\uc2 Argentina\b0 \highlight\uc2  frequently \b \highlight22\uc2 intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2  in \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets to keep the peso trading within a tight band relative to the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , but with a bias toward a gradual depreciation to help exporters but not so much as to add even more fuel to inflation.\par \par \uc2 "Beyond entrenched high inflation, the erosion of external competitiveness during 2010-2011 is another thorny issue the next administration will have to face, which, if not properly handled, could end up generating a crash- rather than soft-landing of the economy in 2012," Ramos wrote.\par \par \uc2 -By Ken Parks, Dow Jones Newswires; 54-11-4103-6740, ken.parks@dowjones.com\par \par \uc2 (END) Dow Jones Newswires\par \par \uc2 March 21, 2011 15:03 ET (19:03 GMT)\par \par \uc2 Dokument DJDN000020110321e73l004cx\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
