\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Argentina \highlight\uc2  Ctrl Bk  \highlight22\uc2 Intervenes \highlight\uc2  As Peso Dives On Pension Reform\b0\par\par\uc2 324 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 21 Oktober 2008\par 15:05\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2008 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 BUENOS AIRES (Dow Jones)--The Argentine \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  heavily in early \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  trading in Buenos Aires Tuesday as the peso dropped on concern about an expected nationalization of the pension fund system.\par \par \uc2 Traders cited as much as three big, dollar-selling \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  within the first hour as the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  sought to contain the peso's decline.\par \par \uc2 Jose Nogueira of ABC Mercado de Cambio said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had offered dollars for pesos on three occasions to a total of $240 million. Others cited a figure of $150 million.\par \par \uc2 Nogueira said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  offered dollars at ARS3.2320 in its last \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . But, he said, "that price won't satisfy the market," which dropped as low as ARS3.25 to the dollar in volatile moves. The local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  closed at ARS3.2275 to the dollar Monday.\par \par \uc2 The last quoted price on the Argentine Electronic Market put the peso at ARS3.2420. Separately, Reuters reported that the peso had initially dropped as far as ARS3.33 to the dollar in the "informal" over-the-counter market.\par \par \uc2 President Cristina Fernandez is scheduled to make a statement at 5:00 p.m. local time (3:00 p.m. EDT) Tuesday where she is expected to announce a planned transfer of the entire balance of funds in Argentina's nine private pension funds, known as AFJPs, into the state-run social security system, ANSES.\par \par \uc2 "The news generated uncertainty and \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  short-covering," said Gustavo Quintana, a trader at Lopez Leon Brokers.\par \par \uc2 Quintana said the medium-term effect of the reform would depend on its implementation, but he added, "the AFJPs are very powerful institutional investors that fuel a lot of the trade volume. The market is going to shrink."\par \par \uc2 -By Michael Casey, Dow Jones Newswires; michael.j.casey@dowjones.com; 54-11-4590 2428\par \par \uc2 (Shane Romig contributed to this article.) [ 21-10-08 1332GMT ]\par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020081021e4al000ph\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
