.   \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's press office wasn't immediately available to comment.   \par \par \uc2 -By Serena Saitto, Dow Jones Newswires; 5411-4311-3125; serena.saitto@dowjones.com [ 16-08-07 2058GMT ]   \par \par \uc2 1156 1843   \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020070816e38g000vj\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
